gerous. Approach with caution.\n</p><p><br>\nWanted: <a href=\"/wiki/Stonelord\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stonelord\">'The Stone Man'</a> - leader of a dangerous criminal enterprise. Reported to travel with a mouse.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715171017\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1640/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27031/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6169/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936651/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.211      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.211      1 -total\n 56.54%   23.864      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.51%   21.322     17 Template:Trim\n 23.36%    9.862      2 Template:Uid\n 15.87%    6.699      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.36%    5.641      2 Template:Template_style\n 13.09%    5.526      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.35%    4.371      1 Template:Notes\n 10.35%    4.370      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:24679-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715171017 and revision id 364861. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}